# Vercel project environment variable (Production + Preview):
# VITE_API_BASE=https://your-api-host.example.com
#
# The frontend defaults to same-origin `/api` when this is unset, which is the
# right setting for the single-container Docker deployment. A Vercel-hosted
# frontend must point at the separately hosted API.
# VITE_API_BASE=https://your-api-host.example.com
